FINDING C01: Missing idempotency check prior to daily limit calculation and ledger posting
Claim: PayAsync does not check whether a payment with (CustomerId, IdempotencyKey) already exists before checking the daily transfer limit and calling ILedger.PostTransferAsync. As a result, retried requests with an existing key can fail daily limit checks or move money again via the ledger instead of returning the existing payment without ledger calls.
