  "reason": "PayAsync never checks if a payment with the given IdempotencyKey already exists before evaluating daily limits and posting the transfer to the ledger. Furthermore, the index on (CustomerId, IdempotencyKey) is not unique (.IsUnique() is missing in BankDbContext), so non-concurrent retries will transfer money multiple times and create duplicate payment records. Even if the index were unique, retries would perform redundant ledger operations and fail prematurely on daily limit checks."
